<title>JAPAN: M'bishi to announce tie-up with Italian car firm.</title>
<headline>M'bishi to announce tie-up with Italian car firm.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsubishi Motors Corp said on Tuesday it will announce at 0730 GMT in Tokyo details of plans to produce a compact sport-utility vehicle with Italian car maker and designer Pininfarina SpA.</p>
</text>
